  "reading": "eFV still predicts WAR; the blend lambda is HOW MUCH to trust eFV's adjustment over the consensus anchor. WAG (realized over/underperformance vs consensus FV = where consensus MISSED) sets lambda ONLY when its predicted-edge -> realized-WAG regression is SIGNIFICANT. As of the 2026 norm-fix that regression is non-significant on BOTH sides (pitchers spearman ~0.001, hitters ~0.066, both bootstrap CIs straddle 0), so a WAG-sized lambda would be noise pinning a rank-suboptimal weight. Both sides therefore size lambda by the RANK GATE directly (rank_calibration): pooled + within-tier + FV45-fringe rank rho maximized in a conservative band -> ~0.70, which lifts the pooled OOS rank rho vs the old WAG-pinned lambda (the robust, CI-positive part of the available gain)."
 },
